  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "去年在北碚治病时，我写了一首小诗：",
      "output_sha256": "fca7ed26587d4bd5e8a08db0c0b4fda330ed2296f52c596e4bf65787dd9b9c7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.676186,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d31b0bd26c3297d4f760878bdfc6ecd6b14a31b335b57c1bd3ae01ff846ea0d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fca7ed26587d4bd5e8a08db0c0b4fda330ed2296f52c596e4bf65787dd9b9c7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“雾中梅花江上烟，小三峡外又新年；病中逢酒仍须醉，家在卢沟桥北边！”",
      "output_sha256": "2295495a532ad84847796070834a317e0c1a819dc3a81c2b1021c3576515c6b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.917549,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f99e2fae581daf69cf5ef3164bd7a0e8a280900c91766bb1c95b83a400b5d7ed"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2295495a532ad84847796070834a317e0c1a819dc3a81c2b1021c3576515c6b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "既病，又值新年，故有流离之感。",
      "output_sha256": "a5f587c18b4d6ac13db3bf0bb3f89376b2d62b03108eab629c616e1187266cf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5f587c18b4d6ac13db3bf0bb3f89376b2d62b03108eab629c616e1187266cf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，这只是那一时的感触。",
      "output_sha256": "0db39f6c47d9d5507c192dce9bc3b852422d658b4987f43f958e9b8b8d47c434",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "0db39f6c47d9d5507c192dce9bc3b852422d658b4987f43f958e9b8b8d47c434",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "及至身体好了一些，便又忘了病痛与乡思，而想打起精神去作事；即使终身流浪，只要儿辈能“家祭无忘告尔翁”以胜利的消息，便死也安心了。",
      "output_sha256": "780ceee5b416fad9816b6741d4d123e034499111ca877bd65e86bf2f3814fd98",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "780ceee5b416fad9816b6741d4d123e034499111ca877bd65e86bf2f3814fd98",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，时至今日，身体仍未完全恢复。",
      "output_sha256": "8d13a0cf66cab8acc5136f7e2a1b192335d4b324944e638b1d0a414a1968b63d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.421278,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b1911cc3e0da40be3f938cb12372143e2b0b7370660fd5ed25ef42d131c08a54"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8d13a0cf66cab8acc5136f7e2a1b192335d4b324944e638b1d0a414a1968b63d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每当我多说几句话或写多一些字，便感到头晕。",
      "output_sha256": "fcefd90c8c7503fdcac0d6a36384fc628983ad743bfde18fc9dd3d933f72fc9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.421278,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b1911cc3e0da40be3f938cb12372143e2b0b7370660fd5ed25ef42d131c08a54"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fcefd90c8c7503fdcac0d6a36384fc628983ad743bfde18fc9dd3d933f72fc9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "非常的着急，但心越急头便越昏——病是我们自己的最大的仇敌！",
      "output_sha256": "4deb939b6097539b4d62ea4428addd7b08dabe5a7100060a60b097a250fe8721",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "4deb939b6097539b4d62ea4428addd7b08dabe5a7100060a60b097a250fe8721",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "医生嘱咐多吃猪肝脑、菠菜与豆腐。",
      "output_sha256": "bbe5eb2fb24d2ada474861d86b2666b12c7f855d8aad36f906bea7ceb6f07891",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbe5eb2fb24d2ada474861d86b2666b12c7f855d8aad36f906bea7ceb6f07891",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，住在别人的家中，怎好意思发号施令？",
      "output_sha256": "7c65b5468d01b010584dc21fa86aeec1aa161beb86479030f1627792d89775f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.745317,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4dabc220c07b836e57a1876e88037038bc7473734f866dc87230b2dd16dd5762"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7c65b5468d01b010584dc21fa86aeec1aa161beb86479030f1627792d89775f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "况且，肉已难买到手，还能强使人家专为我自己去找肝与脑吗？",
      "output_sha256": "8de009973a7425b5f864d322f9e19fe3b6bb1bc6d449fbc1473ed710602b3b4b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "8de009973a7425b5f864d322f9e19fe3b6bb1bc6d449fbc1473ed710602b3b4b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有时候，我后悔结过婚；假若我是独身汉，大概就不会在无聊的时候因想念儿女皱眉。",
      "output_sha256": "b9bd69fd704e0116a7f2cba136427045f7f89795e1faf19a44229247b6aaa569",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9bd69fd704e0116a7f2cba136427045f7f89795e1faf19a44229247b6aaa569",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若无闲愁，或许能多写一些东西。",
      "output_sha256": "b3d9038061c639d4ecc2f19cd003edc41107996fde3e3d868a15103e8eddcb0e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.577619,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "544db139db31250eecba239ec7bf672295026b9b3c2bdeff9f0277aced2df1bf"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b3d9038061c639d4ecc2f19cd003edc41107996fde3e3d868a15103e8eddcb0e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "及至遇到了猪肝这一类问题，我又否定了这个悔意，而切盼家眷能够西来，人生要有多少小小的矛盾才算及格呢？！",
      "output_sha256": "5436baffa3083b2366d811eb15d5fdbab78a81f3d64f58a0403f58ce433c65ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5436baffa3083b2366d811eb15d5fdbab78a81f3d64f58a0403f58ce433c65ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "且不提新的工作，去年未写完的东西到今天还都秃着尾巴。",
      "output_sha256": "03ae898c7a983909240d59f708c4ef34784f292b0cf13fa95b09ccf32bac84fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "03ae898c7a983909240d59f708c4ef34784f292b0cf13fa95b09ccf32bac84fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《剑北篇》，到去年秋季，只成了二十八段。",
      "output_sha256": "8c39876d522123773d1a0a9a449dec8e69a5e8fa2becbb6dca2003bf9089882a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c39876d522123773d1a0a9a449dec8e69a5e8fa2becbb6dca2003bf9089882a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "剩余的材料，大致足以再写十二段。",
      "output_sha256": "83a0fdf7bf602a2053cadf1832dd8f685cc6ceb11c6e45d88a1090c94aff11d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.624812,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ecb3d62e51cdd57b89e58a084562175a93b9919f7bd6580445deeb6eb009c5ab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "83a0fdf7bf602a2053cadf1832dd8f685cc6ceb11c6e45d88a1090c94aff11d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十八加十二，整四十。",
      "output_sha256": "e6d8435b2074f6d0e5b779b9d44efa968b4c34bf6bec7b055be7ed05a612c569",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "e6d8435b2074f6d0e5b779b9d44efa968b4c34bf6bec7b055be7ed05a612c569",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "即使四十段未必能有一万行——原本是想写成一万行的——可是四十这个数倒还整齐，就此结束，未为不可。",
      "output_sha256": "3b05e55c2a67e6ddd47ff0c15db423e16b142ab57f75de9e0f8ac665d461a956",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b05e55c2a67e6ddd47ff0c15db423e16b142ab57f75de9e0f8ac665d461a956",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，过半年了，并没在二十八段之外多添上“一”个字。",
      "output_sha256": "0ea17f64e8d04416736d64e4f6c6314fdb05474406d366de949e4d31d1600803",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ea17f64e8d04416736d64e4f6c6314fdb05474406d366de949e4d31d1600803",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "每逢有空袭，我必抱着那足以再成十二段的材料入洞；纸已有了破烂的地方，而我还没能把这些将要模糊的字变成韵语。",
      "output_sha256": "8d8ca64f72c9d07bdb4667703262059c6810cfaba74b05310dfdf6b4544ee629",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d8ca64f72c9d07bdb4667703262059c6810cfaba74b05310dfdf6b4544ee629",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这简直是块心病！",
      "output_sha256": "8d5a94d047853b74cf96c47de899739f8cd8cb77470f1d1b4dde994c1880f249",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "8d5a94d047853b74cf96c47de899739f8cd8cb77470f1d1b4dde994c1880f249",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "即使我能写成四十段，它们究竟能否算作诗，还是个问题，我心里明白。",
      "output_sha256": "76f83778a214aca7255967dcd80085471a0d1261348a2e4c9486f1da237a7621",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.70316,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "60a090e567e919013d455b7e2881d08485ae019ce3c08152fe6a4459d7811771"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "76f83778a214aca7255967dcd80085471a0d1261348a2e4c9486f1da237a7621",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那么，写完或写不完，又有什么关系呢？",
      "output_sha256": "509044de018413636a231f3fb659a9afc73fe0a0528741fccb0bfe7f225d732c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "509044de018413636a231f3fb659a9afc73fe0a0528741fccb0bfe7f225d732c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不过，“把戏是假的，工夫是真的”，我愿把它写完。",
      "output_sha256": "58df21f267065e1dc3d29fa298df50698e572b6fabfa489f682d86bfb26f83ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "58df21f267065e1dc3d29fa298df50698e572b6fabfa489f682d86bfb26f83ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "假若我去扫地，我应把地扫干净。",
      "output_sha256": "6ddbf837cdf3061ea4c5e823956d0e39c9a42baf283582129854750dafb5dde1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ddbf837cdf3061ea4c5e823956d0e39c9a42baf283582129854750dafb5dde1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "同样的，尽管写得完整并不意味着写得美好，我仍愿意将它完成。",
      "output_sha256": "8eb516c24a928f72c87b03a0ddf3d20a462b13357cf5c224149003be38e1ef33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.626621,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a0d4584ca9e01f277d495e9d9ec4f49323586e21677aa0ececd5654a3567925"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8eb516c24a928f72c87b03a0ddf3d20a462b13357cf5c224149003be38e1ef33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我总觉得有始有终是个好的习惯，虽然这个办法也许并不适用于文艺习作上。",
      "output_sha256": "633d7aadee5480c4d615edef955fcdd7bbb33249c96a42ea68be43f8e373141a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "633d7aadee5480c4d615edef955fcdd7bbb33249c96a42ea68be43f8e373141a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "今年春天，《新蜀报》决定出版文艺丛书，便将《剑北篇》的前二十段取走，先行出版上册；待全篇完成后，再出下册。",
      "output_sha256": "d4c4d95c05d3fe8e2cbebca5aa38898ed49b47efee216869bb2daec2166e4659",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.697449,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "304ee97629b489aed7f4b3a1d9b5cda4d887cfc7d487c4646ee2f61149425987"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d4c4d95c05d3fe8e2cbebca5aa38898ed49b47efee216869bb2daec2166e4659",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "上册刚刚印好，恰巧新蜀印厂发生火灾，随之化为灰烬。",
      "output_sha256": "e137d791b70eae4619d547a7fef2ce0b8e34436d8cb0531a935803b0592cd8af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.551142,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4c8e33414a9fb803ad24f5fe22cc4fcff01c253b6092ec7a39083a43e4bbb873"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e137d791b70eae4619d547a7fef2ce0b8e34436d8cb0531a935803b0592cd8af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莫非这是一个什么谴责么？",
      "output_sha256": "2fcc3e046282bd91cbcbcc4e6cd6491d2248f506c3cc2c44de0a1b82c490c075",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "2fcc3e046282bd91cbcbcc4e6cd6491d2248f506c3cc2c44de0a1b82c490c075",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "虽然我并不迷信。",
      "output_sha256": "5c35e93fc3216ae81e7fcc968c7c10c846530bbf5b36f97bcee888ba13b4961c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c35e93fc3216ae81e7fcc968c7c10c846530bbf5b36f97bcee888ba13b4961c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《无形的防线》是个四幕的剧本，从去冬到现在只有了两幕。",
      "output_sha256": "d9d65241d9171d98b6aef3dcc3dfe9b207fa49f0f0d15873cc0490d15ee2cb09",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "d9d65241d9171d98b6aef3dcc3dfe9b207fa49f0f0d15873cc0490d15ee2cb09",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "已写好的两幕，经过朋友们的审阅后，必须大幅修改，才能使后两幕变得精彩。",
      "output_sha256": "063c9c40a16d72c95baa8b781033dd935c3ff1dfed4d7500ebe08215d1a77d7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.553836,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5bcf4c0829c428d71d27d837771665ab970440adbd7cfbd576b7d402f0771845"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "063c9c40a16d72c95baa8b781033dd935c3ff1dfed4d7500ebe08215d1a77d7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，这该改正的几十张纸也只做了我的伴侣，别无关系。",
      "output_sha256": "400bfcb67e9d3f3fa83c5769dccb54323b20d6084392ce0e9a19da4e6896b8b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "400bfcb67e9d3f3fa83c5769dccb54323b20d6084392ce0e9a19da4e6896b8b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每当看到它们，我便感到伤心；一拿起笔来，头又开始晕眩！",
      "output_sha256": "4bc2e113087fef20b231f1b7805a2eb7e203dec5fe278cdc31b59ca14883567f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.501054,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a554eda3fdc45a62da8f4f03c06e73978c5be020fbbba270b6fb996eddb14e2e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4bc2e113087fef20b231f1b7805a2eb7e203dec5fe278cdc31b59ca14883567f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "《面子问题》——三幕剧本——算是写完了。",
      "output_sha256": "78dbcc3c433d1c7e7e7ef9ce8329a3e0f524cbdc7399c64c71116988589ae1da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "78dbcc3c433d1c7e7e7ef9ce8329a3e0f524cbdc7399c64c71116988589ae1da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "写完它的那一天，我的头晕开始。",
      "output_sha256": "66b4d2a01b1edff22de340d8f0d179cbf098e2bfa8afcb55fc1834b3c91943a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "66b4d2a01b1edff22de340d8f0d179cbf098e2bfa8afcb55fc1834b3c91943a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有好多新的意思，写完才想起来，都应当加进去。",
      "output_sha256": "6eca1bb847ac947672296b3ff6685d4dccdfd59f816c0e7b827346fdc11c04c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "6eca1bb847ac947672296b3ff6685d4dccdfd59f816c0e7b827346fdc11c04c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若想加入这些内容，势必得从头重写；但头晕阻碍了我如此行事。",
      "output_sha256": "b27365f9a9518b54b114bc735147e458899b2c337d1b37cf285701da66abe947",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.473077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a6d97f45f67fc5e67b3377a6dbf0951dbb6155eedd0c73624576440be76aec01"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b27365f9a9518b54b114bc735147e458899b2c337d1b37cf285701da66abe947",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "旧欠未清，新的工作就无从说起。",
      "output_sha256": "fca83e1240e1a5ae73356e1cee4fbff397a56e4dee6206bee22b916cd99767f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "fca83e1240e1a5ae73356e1cee4fbff397a56e4dee6206bee22b916cd99767f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "今天，又到了“七七”——半年多，什么也没写出来！",
      "output_sha256": "b14c1b75c601ed1a55bf2258804a1a2f411c729f639737b11491ca9be836fab7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.865789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "853960cb96b544bfc3e40ac7c50b5393ce90c057b85426201044472af11d0208"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b14c1b75c601ed1a55bf2258804a1a2f411c729f639737b11491ca9be836fab7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "头一个“七七”，我在青岛。",
      "output_sha256": "ee8fac37043337944d21f392f797b527b80e2c49ccea1310d7b90a2d627bee3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee8fac37043337944d21f392f797b527b80e2c49ccea1310d7b90a2d627bee3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第二个，在武昌。",
      "output_sha256": "d80bc5d5d955a8378414b673821ef820cbb009effa3fa0ce187adef4e5ef3e4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "d80bc5d5d955a8378414b673821ef820cbb009effa3fa0ce187adef4e5ef3e4a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第三个，在留侯祠。",
      "output_sha256": "05fa9be19e46bc5cdbf3335dbf2bc9dc42d175fffc456fd534635d3a998f41c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "05fa9be19e46bc5cdbf3335dbf2bc9dc42d175fffc456fd534635d3a998f41c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第四个，在陈家桥。",
      "output_sha256": "18ca92dd0f4309dd61768b2e60fecb5d4f9e220a49f7f245f83bb6c88b42b0ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "18ca92dd0f4309dd61768b2e60fecb5d4f9e220a49f7f245f83bb6c88b42b0ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "今天，这第五个“七七”，是我第一次在陪都纪念它。",
      "output_sha256": "1a94719acd81669cd3afe3be1aa0274d56f49c96679ac4951020cdd4e1f6b0df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.891316,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c75d6d942769d5d606f4d1ff1b12edb68a01aeb6203aaf92bf3d41b2e56c300c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1a94719acd81669cd3afe3be1aa0274d56f49c96679ac4951020cdd4e1f6b0df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像我这样的一个没有什么用处的人，遇到这样伟大的日子，实在不敢讲说什么，要说，只好说说自己。",
      "output_sha256": "29a7810451604cf17f35dea447d054144a2f2df03bcdd5bc09a4fc5ea8598663",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "29a7810451604cf17f35dea447d054144a2f2df03bcdd5bc09a4fc5ea8598663",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我始终认为，每个人都应该尽力去做他能做的事，并经过客观的批判——这才是最有意义的事情，或许社会也能从中获益。",
      "output_sha256": "995bef48e287dcd042ebf160db03969e5589894002eaa86e11275246f9d8c316",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.52676,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "787661324a8da355cade4f7282853707ec8a465459740a87ae30d840691e26ca"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "995bef48e287dcd042ebf160db03969e5589894002eaa86e11275246f9d8c316",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我自己没有什么本事，除了能写点平庸而有时候还清楚的文字。",
      "output_sha256": "ee0ce092e7239cafa41027fcdcebfbe424400f548da0087f7d8cecede9533c34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee0ce092e7239cafa41027fcdcebfbe424400f548da0087f7d8cecede9533c34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "写出来的小说或剧本，虽说不算什么文艺，但也许能够给一个年轻人、一个老人，或一个受伤的士兵带来一点向上的鼓励，或一丝安慰；这便不是白费了心血。",
      "output_sha256": "65a8be9d8ebcf33c8a5bf34bb2373013aaa4a51dd4145a42d3ed7210347a4c40",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.599841,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d0df076baffe2310d73b0fe23669bebdedbc0cdbb31e2e088ed8326f12106d1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "65a8be9d8ebcf33c8a5bf34bb2373013aaa4a51dd4145a42d3ed7210347a4c40",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是我能做的，且我客观认为并非全无意义，所以我愿意如此行事。",
      "output_sha256": "2d639823d1d604248b963a702e821be8b6a3a86219f38a921f5a261c01b990b4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.591767,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "205c9fe3c371b3db8763f40c62468ba4c44124360833e46e615619050aa0b64e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2d639823d1d604248b963a702e821be8b6a3a86219f38a921f5a261c01b990b4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在抗战前与抗战中，我始终如一地坚持着我的笔。",
      "output_sha256": "ace5648d5e0c653052ac1d6f749f832dc86855b430ab726952ab2b74acfe4dad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.591767,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "205c9fe3c371b3db8763f40c62468ba4c44124360833e46e615619050aa0b64e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ace5648d5e0c653052ac1d6f749f832dc86855b430ab726952ab2b74acfe4dad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个人也许不见得能充分了解他自己吧？",
      "output_sha256": "5d65917115ba4037ff4f921a563b057468aad10d54447f1f685df1583fe66549",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "5d65917115ba4037ff4f921a563b057468aad10d54447f1f685df1583fe66549",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "假如我去做些别的事情，或许能取得更好的成绩。",
      "output_sha256": "5da934a20467aa015febc48ebf49aff24ef318080832c2196a21d08c60703d68",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.621129,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ebbeeaf96d3014c166dd3c8c0aa56251539fab8f0eebcdf3011c304b0aae6320"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5da934a20467aa015febc48ebf49aff24ef318080832c2196a21d08c60703d68",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，我不冒险。",
      "output_sha256": "a0d739ad6c7506df1abf7489aaaf12edbc24d33abb4b17526673e765cd70882d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0d739ad6c7506df1abf7489aaaf12edbc24d33abb4b17526673e765cd70882d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个看起来好像是“消极的”态度，却足以保证自己不是以文艺为敲门砖，而到时候就可以放下纸笔，另有所图。",
      "output_sha256": "50507505a9978877c0ad7a23a492c1cccc3ee1a94830edfcbfdaee086f7d2558",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "50507505a9978877c0ad7a23a492c1cccc3ee1a94830edfcbfdaee086f7d2558",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有些人，我曾看见，以为别人从事文艺是为了给他们自己搭一座浮桥，等到走过了河便把桥拆掉，而永远不再提起文艺。",
      "output_sha256": "320c523cc87e77adfb230515a324cb823fa7ee3ded51550128d67900466011cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "320c523cc87e77adfb230515a324cb823fa7ee3ded51550128d67900466011cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，这些人在一开始弄文艺的时候，便先要打倒别人，诟骂别人，不过也是给自己搭起浮桥而已。",
      "output_sha256": "72ebbd0564170dcf240509d865fa364f91376854099e951a40a2dadcc7b76f24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "72ebbd0564170dcf240509d865fa364f91376854099e951a40a2dadcc7b76f24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这样的人，我永远不愿说什么；即使他们骂到我自己的头上来，我还是相应不理，而只为文艺伤心罢了。",
      "output_sha256": "1e3f16afafc115ea6fa7fd1abba01046b625c08f30a813544264e6adaf3a5271",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e3f16afafc115ea6fa7fd1abba01046b625c08f30a813544264e6adaf3a5271",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在这个消极的态度中，我保持着些积极的精神，文艺决定不是我的浮桥，而是我的生命。",
      "output_sha256": "5dc910df2dfd897cbc372a12b01f2a1f48052f127c0a75af0eb91077cd26e8cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "5dc910df2dfd897cbc372a12b01f2a1f48052f127c0a75af0eb91077cd26e8cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
